OL,3,GNEWSAI joined Karl Bushby on his
OL,4,Around-the-world walk
OL,5,
OL,6,FAdventurer Karl Bushby has been walking
OL,7,Faround the world for 28 years and now
OL,8,Fthe end of his journey is in sight.
OL,10,FI have been writing about him for most
OL,11,Fof that time, but although we have
OL,12,Fspoken frequently and exchanged
OL,13,Fhundreds of emails we have never met.
OL,15,FWe are in the village of Havre and I am
OL,16,Fjoining Karl on a five-mile (8km)
OL,17,Fstretch to Mons. It is part of the
OL,18,Ffinal march to Calais, from where he
OL,19,Fplans to swim across the English
OL,20,FChannel in October.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
