OL,3,GNEWSAI joined Karl Bushby on his
OL,4,Around-the-world walk
OL,5,
OL,6,FDressed in shorts and a T-shirt which
OL,7,Fbears evidence of a roadside repair,
OL,8,FKarl - sporting a grey beard - appears
OL,9,Fin the car park of a Belgian railway
OL,10,Fstation.
